# Installation Manual — Scropcombinator (Hacker News Scraper)

Step-by-step guide to install, configure, run and deploy **backend** (Cloudflare Worker) and **frontend** (React + Vite), including Cloudflare **cron triggers**, **environment variables/secrets**, and production wiring.

**Target audience:** developers installing the app for the first time on Windows, macOS or Linux.

