## 1. Prerequisites

| Tool | Version (recommended) | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Node.js** | 20 LTS or later | Runtime for npm, Vite, Wrangler, Vitest |
| **npm** | ships with Node | Package manager |
| **Git** | any recent | Clone the repository |
| **Cloudflare account** | Free tier is enough | Host the Worker + cron |
| **Wrangler CLI** | installed as backend devDependency (`npx wrangler`) | Local dev & deploy |
| Network access | — | `news.ycombinator.com`, `hacker-news.firebaseio.com` (fallback), `firestore.googleapis.com`, Cloudflare |

Optional:

- **Firebase console** access to project `test-2eb64` (or your own) if you change Firestore rules/config.
- A terminal that supports long-running processes (or two separate terminals for backend + frontend).

